  "retrieved": "2026-07-20",
  "label": "OAE HQ Geo-Informatics Center (ศูนย์สารสนเทศการเกษตร) satellite-derived standing/planted-area-by-amphoe PDFs, mirrored on zone10.oae.go.th, filtered to this zone's provinces",
  "crops_present": [
